<title>USA: Mcmoran oil &amp; gas prev q2 includes $0.15/.</title>
<headline>Mcmoran oil &amp; gas prev q2 includes $0.15/.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter	    Six Months</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>			  (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p> Revenues	     $ 2,248    $  949     $ 5,021    $ 2,022</p>
<p>  Net income (loss)  (1,395)a     525b     (3,884)a   (3,805)b</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>   per share	    (0.10)a    0.04b	(0.27)a    (0.27)b</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>    outstanding	14,160    13,867	 14,136     13,847</p>
<p>a.  Includes a gain of $2.3 million ($0.16 per share) resulting from the sale of the West Cameron Block 503 property and $1.0 million ($0.07/shr) of additional depreciation from downward revisions to reserve estimates for the Vermilion Block 410 property.</p>
<p>b.  Includes a reduction to exploration expense of $2.1 million ($0.15/shr) resulting from the reimbursement of previously expensed costs.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
